# GDGOC Kickoff Event Website - COMSATS Attock Campus

A responsive, semantic HTML5 webpage built for the **GDGOC Web Team Challenge**. This website showcases the Google Developer Groups on Campus (GDGOC) Kickoff Event held at COMSATS University Islamabad, Attock Campus.

